":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1015","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[11,22,54,50,46,37],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1016505","helmet":"WP1028105"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国学者，擅读《春秋》的名著典籍。郭恩曾经因与兄弟三人得了瘸脚病而向管辂问卜，在其指示之下，意外发现了郭恩隐瞒的命案，郭恩供认不讳，前去认罪。","tc":"魏國學者，擅讀《春秋》的名著典籍。郭恩曾經因與兄弟三人得了瘸腳病而向管輅問卜，在其指示之下，意外發現了郭恩隱瞞的命案，郭恩供認不諱，前去認罪。","en":"A scholar of Wei who was well-read in renowned classics such as the ‘Spring and Autumn Annals’. Guo En once consulted the diviner Guan Lu about a lameness afflicting himself and his two brothers. Following Guan Lu's instructions, a murder that Guo En had concealed was unexpectedly uncovered. Guo En made a full confession and went to face justice.","jp":"魏の学者。『春秋』をはじめとする古典の名著に精通していた。かつて兄弟三人揃って足萎えを患った際、管輅に占いを依頼した。管輅の指摘によって、隠蔽していた殺人事件が思いがけず露見することとなり、郭恩は罪を認めて自首した。","kr":"위나라의 학자로, 《춘추》를 비롯한 명저와 전적에 능통했다. 곽은은 일찍이 세 형제와 함께 다리를 저는 병을 앓자 관로에게 점을 쳤는데, 관로의 지시로 곽은이 숨겨 온 살인 사건이 뜻밖에 드러났고, 이에 곽은은 죄를 숨김없이 자백하고 자수했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10889","remark":"","surname":"郭","surnameTc":"郭","surnameEn":"Guo","surnameJp":"郭","surnameKr":"곽","surnameOther":"","name":"恩","nameTc":"恩","nameEn":"En","nameJp":"恩","nameKr":"은","nameOther":"","word":"义博","wordTc":"義博","wordEn":"Yibo","wordJp":"義博","wordKr":"의박","wordOther":"","icon":"郭恩","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"205","city":"CS1026","gender":"0","rule":"11","force":"22","wise":"54","politics":"50","charm":"46","will":"37","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"3","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"5","weaponMaster":"18/18/18/18/18/53/28/18","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/